# Comparison on a dynamic conversion that promotes the base type

Verifies a comparison against a converted dynamic element resolves the relation
for the representation the conversion actually produced, so a promoted decimal
centimeter magnitude still compares correctly and yields `true`.

>>> source
let sizes: int[] = [10mm]
let index = 0
print((sizes[index] -> to(cm)) > 0cm)

<<< stdout
true

<<< stderr
